            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Serenity Vulnerability"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A demonic rabble thrives on mayhem, and when members of the throng find themselves facing moments of calm, however brief or temporary, the throng suffers. Whenever the demonic rabble fails a saving throw against an affect that would normally fascinate, fatigue, paralyze, restrain, or slow at least four creatures, the troop takes 3d6 mental damage."
